+
+## Difficulty presets
+
+| Preset | Cubic vertices `n` | SAT variables | Choice groups | Check clauses | Status |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|
+| `easy` | 12 | 54 | 18 | 36 | Oracle solved 3/3; demo only |
