+G12: 12 33 11
+G13: 20 19 53
+G14: 35 24 21
+G15: 23 41 1
+G16: 10 38 9
+G17: 51 3 48
+
+CHECK CLAUSES (36 triples)
+C0: 8 20 30
+C1: 49 39 21
+C2: 3 8 5
+C3: 25 23 53
+C4: 25 15 9
+C5: 36 35 44
+C6: 14 6 34
+C7: 44 31 53
+C8: 27 22 37
+C9: 45 29 40
+C10: 47 45 51
+C11: 16 12 36
+C12: 52 24 38
+C13: 18 0 33
+C14: 28 41 32
+C15: 42 1 19
+C16: 9 29 35
